 "changed": {
  "454:tua chwech o’r gloch": "tua, chwech, o’r, gloch untiled; Korean 여섯 시쯤 one unit, like am chwech o’r gloch (18)",
  "455:oedd y plant wedi blino": "y, plant, wedi untiled and oedd alone is 응 그랬어 (279); one clause",
  "456:efallai bod o": "efallai, bod, o untiled (older seeds); shortest frame",
  "456:dydy o ddim yn": "o, ddim, yn untiled; one frame like doedd o ddim yn (105)",
  "457:rhan o’r broblem ydy": "source rhan o’r + broblem + untiled ydy; Korean 문제의 일부는 ~야 one frame",
  "457:nifer yr": "nifer, yr untiled; shortest frame, like nifer y myfyrwyr (434)",
  "458:oedd o i gyd yn": "o, i, gyd, yn untiled and oedd alone is 응 그랬어 (279); one frame",
  "459:doedd o ddim": "untiled; shortest frame, distinct from doedd o ddim yn (105)",
  "464:ddudes i": "source ddudes i rif fy ystafell wrthi is over 8 syllables; taught ddudes i (296) + rhif fy ystafell (463) + wrthi + wrthi (그녀에게 is taken by iddi hi, 242, so 그녀한테)",
  "464:wnaeth hi anghofio fo": "source wnaeth hi anghofio + untiled fo; one unit",
  "466:daflu fo": "source daflu + untiled fo; Korean 그걸 던지다 one unit, like ddeud o (208)",
  "466:dros y wal": "source dros + wal with y untiled; one unit",
  "472:nad ydan ni ddim yn gwybod": "source nad ydan ni ddim + untiled yn; Korean 우리가 모른다는 것 one unit",
  "472:y ffeithiau": "source ffeithiau + untiled y",
  "473:dw i ddim isio fo": "fo untiled; one unit, 나는 ~고 싶지 않아 (dw i ddim isio) needs a verb",
  "474:fel cynnig": "fel untiled and cynnig is taught as the verb 제안하다 (327); noun unit",
  "475:aros": "untiled (older seeds)",
  "479:dyna’r lleia’": "source lleia’ + untiled dyna’r; one unit like dyna’r ffordd orau (408)"
 },
